#: manifest.json
msgid "Smoother motion with real in-between frames from your AMD Radeon GPU"
msgstr "用 AMD Radeon GPU 生成真实的中间帧，让画面运动更流畅"

#: manifest.json
msgid ""
"Doubles the video's frame rate while it plays, with in-between frames made by the motion estimation of AMD's frame-rate converter (AMF) on your AMD Radeon GPU: not blended frames. Video ▸ AMD Motion Smoothing… opens a window to choose Off, Double Frame Rate or Match Display (the doubled frames paced to the display, with GPU rendering) and shows what runs or why not. The command palette and Ask Vestra can also choose a mode in one step. Needs Windows with an AMD Radeon GPU and the AMD graphics driver; it does nothing on other GPUs or systems. Off by default; remembers your choice.\n"
"→ Menu: Video ▸ AMD Motion Smoothing"
msgstr ""
"播放时把视频帧率提高一倍，中间帧由 AMD Radeon GPU 上 AMD 帧率转换器（AMF）的运动估计生成，而不是两帧混合。“视频 ▸ AMD 运动平滑…”打开一个窗口，可选“关”“双倍帧率”或“匹配显示器”（双倍后的帧再按显示器刷新率输出，需 GPU 渲染），并显示当前效果或不能使用的原因。也可以在命令面板或 Ask Vestra 中一步选择模式。需要装有 AMD Radeon GPU 和 AMD 显卡驱动的 Windows；在其他 GPU 或系统上不起作用。默认关闭，会记住你的选择。\n"
"→ 菜单：视频 ▸ AMD 运动平滑"

